  INSERT INTO academy_exercises (program_id, order_index, lesson_order, title, prompt, self_check, model_answer) VALUES (pid, 2, 3, $t$Rewrite the risky sentence$t$, $p$A colleague drafted: "We guarantee you'll stop losing customers — most of our clients make thousands more every month." Rewrite it so it is honest and allowed.$p$, $s$["Did you remove the guarantee?","Did you remove the invented figure and the claim about other clients?","Does your version describe what Nova actually does?"]$s$::jsonb, $m$We look at where customers may be slipping through — missed calls, slow replies, unclear booking — and show you what we find with evidence, so you can decide what is worth fixing.$m$)
